										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Receive personal assistance around the clock with Now Brief. The improved Now Brief provides more personalized updates, briefing you with information related to your interests or current situation. It also reminds you of important upcoming events with notifications and messages, and suggests related actions.<sup>4</sup></p>
