						<p class="st-feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="14">Discover the most personalized version of One UI. Get creative on the Home screen and Lock screen, now with more freedom to optimize things to your liking. Complete the Home screen by placing app icons, shortcuts, folders and widgets in different sizes to where it feels natural to you. Style the Lock screen with a clock and other widgets. Change the clock's font and color, or leave it to One UI to automatically adjust the clock for you with the Stretch Clock feature.</p>
						
