									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">One UI 8.5 goes beyond being just smart, it's also aesthetically pleasing. Status bars and navigation bar blend better into the screen for a smooth look. While you scroll down, components like the bar at the top of the app screen and navigation buttons at the bottom disappear, providing a wider view of the screen with less distractions. Things got smarter with a simple, seamless design.</p>
