									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Turn your wallpaper from good to great with One UI 8.5. When you're setting up the Lock screen, the image is automatically positioned so that the important part doesn't overlap with the clock or other widgets. You can even drag the image down — the top part will be filled in naturally, making the wallpaper look more pleasant.</p>
									</div>
