										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/one_ui/oneui_13_privacy_alerts_pc_570x448.jpg?$570_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/one_ui/oneui_13_privacy_alerts_mo_720x444.jpg?$720_N_JPG$" alt="A Galaxy smartphone with Security and privacy feature onscreen. At the top is privacy alert: CNRT accessed your precise location. Below is a message 1 more alert and Learn more button. Below the button is Security section with Lock screen and Account security enabled." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
