					<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/one_ui/oneui_15_security_pc_484x298.jpg?$484_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/one_ui/oneui_15_security_mo_720x280.jpg?$720_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A Samsung Knox logo" data-mobile-alt="A Samsung Knox logo" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
				
