<div class="su-g-accordion-faqs aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">













<div class="ab-g-list-exp section">
	<ul class="su12-accordion-faqs  " role="list">
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item on" an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what is new in one ui 8 5" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="true" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What&#39;s new in One UI 8.5?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id03">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">One UI 8.5 comes with newly enhanced AI features, a refreshed design and advanced security and privacy solutions. Together, they help you get things done more efficiently, enjoy a more seamless and consistent experience and keep your private data better protected across your Galaxy devices. 
<br /><br />
<b>• AI features: </b>introduces upgraded Photo Assist for smarter photo editing, along with other features like Now Nudge for a more refined AI experience. Explore more AI features that make your life smarter and easier in One UI 8.5.
<br /><br />
<div class="raw-cta-wrap">
	<a href="#go-to-ai" class="cta-anchor" target="_self">Go to Galaxy AI section</a>
</div>
<br /><br />
<b>• Design: </b>provides a wider view of the screen and a smoother user experience with redesigned navigation bars and menu. 
<br /><br />
<div class="raw-cta-wrap">
	<a href="#go-to-design" class="cta-anchor" target="_self" title="Next-level UI">Go to UI section</a>
</div>
<br /><br />
<b>• Privacy and Security: </b>offers robust privacy protection with Samsung Knox, a hardware-based security solution, and keeps your personal information safe with Privacy Display and Privacy Alerts.
<br /><br />
<div class="raw-cta-wrap">
	<a href="#go-to-privacy-and-security" class="cta-anchor" target="_self">Go to Privacy and Security section</a>
</div></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what is one ui" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What is One UI?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id111">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">One UI is Samsung's innovative software, designed for intuitive and connected user experience on your Galaxy devices. With Galaxy AI deeply integrated, One UI 8.5 helps you get through your day quicker and more effortlessly by providing instant assistance.
<br /><br />
• The upgraded One UI 8.5 now understands your usage patterns and your needs, delivering a more personalized and convenient experience.
<br /><br />
• With advanced AI features like Now Nudge, you can easily access shortcuts to the next possible action without having to jump between apps.
<br /><br />
• AI Agent takes the burden off your tedious tasks, helping you get things done faster. Simply tap or enter a short prompt to get what you need. 
<br /><br />
• By having One UI 8.5 on your device, you can easily adjust the wallpaper for a cleaner look and quickly access your most used apps by customizing the Quick Panel.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what kind of galaxy devices are compatible with one ui 8 5" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What kind of Galaxy devices are compatible with One UI 8.5?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id290">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">One UI 8.5 will be first introduced with Galaxy S26, Galaxy S26+ and Galaxy S26 Ultra. The One UI 8.5 update will expand to more Galaxy devices as the rollout continues.
<br /><br />
<b>Note: </b>The availability of AI features may vary depending on the device model.
<br /><br />
You can download the Samsung Members app to check which devices are compatible with One UI 8.5. 
<br /><br />
<div class="raw-cta-wrap">
	<a href="https://contents.samsungmembers.com/share/redirect.html?dl=view/notice&amp;src=s_com" class="cta-outlink" title="Open in a new window : " target="_blank">Learn more about Samsung Members</a>
</div></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:how do i know when one ui updates will be released" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">How do I know when One UI updates will be released?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id316">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">You can download the Samsung Members app to check the release date.
<br /><br />
<div class="raw-cta-wrap">
	<a href="https://contents.samsungmembers.com/share/redirect.html?dl=view/notice&amp;src=s_com" class="cta-outlink" title="Open in a new window : " target="_blank">Learn more about Samsung Members</a>
</div></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:how can i update one ui" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">How can I update One UI?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id436">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">To update One UI, go to Settings &gt; Software update &gt; Download and install, then tap 'Check for updates'.
<br /><br />
<b>Note: </b>Update is only available for supported devices with the latest version of One UI.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what can i customize on galaxy smartphones with one ui 8 5" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What can I customize on Galaxy smartphones with One UI 8.5?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id537">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">With One UI 8.5, you can make your device truly yours by personalizing the Quick Panel, Home screen and Lock screen. Enjoy easier access to everyday controls with a more balanced look.
<br /><br />
<b>• Quick Panel: </b>Customize the Quick Panel by adding or deleting items to get a quick access to your favorite apps. You can also resize and rearrange the brightness and sound bars to optimize your viewing experience.
<br /><br />
<b>• Home screen &amp; Lock screen: </b>When you set the wallpaper, the image is automatically repositioned to align better with key apps and widgets on your screen, delivering a cleaner layout.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what are the main ai features available in one ui 8 5" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What are the main AI features available in One UI 8.5? </div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id685">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">One UI 8.5 introduces improved Galaxy AI features designed to streamline your day. Explore the AI features that fit your needs, and use them in moments when they matter most.
<br /><br />
<b>• Photo Assist: </b>helps you edit your photos much smarter and faster. Just describe what you want in natural language, and Galaxy AI makes smart edits to your photo by adding objects, removing background distractions or adjusting the overall mood.
<br /><br />
<b>• Now Nudge: </b>provides helpful suggestions using real-time on-screen recognition and your personalized data. No matter what you're talking about, it reads your screen and provides related information or suggests the next step.
<br /><br />
<b>Note: </b>The availability of AI features may vary depending on the device model, language or region.<br />
Additional AI features are available in One UI 8.5 beyond the ones listed above.
<br /><br />
<div class="raw-cta-wrap">
	<a href="https://www.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-ai/" class="cta-outlink" title="Open in a new window : " target="_blank">Learn more about Galaxy AI</a>
</div></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:how do i access each ai feature" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">How do I access each AI feature?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id753">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Galaxy AI features are easy to access, with just a tap or by taking simple steps. With easy access, you can effortlessly use the features whenever you need them.
<br /><br />
<b>• Photo Assist: </b>Open the Gallery app on your device and choose the photo you want to edit. Then, tap the Photo Assist icon.
<br /><br />
<b>• Now Nudge: </b>After enabling it in the Settings menu, Now Nudge will be ready to help you the moment you open the Messenger app.
<br /><br />
<b>Note: </b>The availability of AI features may vary depending on the device model, language or region.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:how does pde personal data engine keep my personal data safe" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">How does PDE (Personal Data Engine) keep my personal data safe?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id888">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">PDE (Personal Data Engine) uses KEEP (Knox Enhanced Encrypted Protection) to store sensitive data in a secure, encrypted storage area, protecting your personal info from unauthorized access. PDE also keeps your data safe by minimizing data sharing while providing helpful AI experiences.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-apps detail-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what solutions are available for privacy security" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What solutions are available for Privacy &amp; Security?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id986">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Knox Vault is a hardware-based security solution that safeguards your device from software and hardware attacks by protecting sensitive data, including PINs, passwords and biometric data in an isolated, secure environment.
<br /><br />
<b>• Software attacks: </b>Unauthorized attempts to access and steal data by exploiting software vulnerabilities on a device.
<br /><br />
<b>• Hardware attacks: </b>Attempts to attain data through physical access, such as device disassembly, exposure to extreme high or low temperatures, voltage glitching or side-channel attacks.
<br /><br /></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
	</ul>
</div>

  <script type="application/ld+json" data-type="seo" data-object-type="FAQPage" data-id="037ab6b8-4da3-47dc-9faf-ac59f0300aa2">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.samsung.com/pk/one-ui/#FAQ","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What's new in One UI 8.5?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One UI 8.5 comes with newly enhanced AI features, a refreshed design and advanced security and privacy solutions. Together, they help you get things done more efficiently, enjoy a more seamless and consistent experience and keep your private data better protected across your Galaxy devices. \r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• AI features: </b>introduces upgraded Photo Assist for smarter photo editing, along with other features like Now Nudge for a more refined AI experience. Explore more AI features that make your life smarter and easier in One UI 8.5.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<div class=\"raw-cta-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"#go-to-ai\" class=\"cta-anchor\" target=\"_self\">Go to Galaxy AI section</a>\r\n</div>\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• Design: </b>provides a wider view of the screen and a smoother user experience with redesigned navigation bars and menu. \r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<div class=\"raw-cta-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"#go-to-design\" class=\"cta-anchor\" target=\"_self\" title=\"Next-level UI\">Go to UI section</a>\r\n</div>\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• Privacy and Security: </b>offers robust privacy protection with Samsung Knox, a hardware-based security solution, and keeps your personal information safe with Privacy Display and Privacy Alerts.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<div class=\"raw-cta-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"#go-to-privacy-and-security\" class=\"cta-anchor\" target=\"_self\">Go to Privacy and Security section</a>\r\n</div>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is One UI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One UI is Samsung's innovative software, designed for intuitive and connected user experience on your Galaxy devices. With Galaxy AI deeply integrated, One UI 8.5 help