el, language or region.<br/>\r\nAdditional AI features are available in One UI 8.5 beyond the ones listed above.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<div class=\"raw-cta-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https://www.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-ai/\" class=\"cta-outlink\" title=\"Open in a new window : \" target=\"_blank\">Learn more about Galaxy AI</a>\r\n</div>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I access each AI feature?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy AI features are easy to access, with just a tap or by taking simple steps. With easy access, you can effortlessly use the features whenever you need them.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• Photo Assist: </b>Open the Gallery app on your device and choose the photo you want to edit. Then, tap the Photo Assist icon.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• Now Nudge: </b>After enabling it in the Settings menu, Now Nudge will be ready to help you the moment you open the Messenger app.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>Note: </b>The availability of AI features may vary depending on the device model, language or region."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does PDE (Personal Data Engine) keep my personal data safe?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PDE (Personal Data Engine) uses KEEP (Knox Enhanced Encrypted Protection) to store sensitive data in a secure, encrypted storage area, protecting your personal info from unauthorized access. PDE also keeps your data safe by minimizing data sharing while providing helpful AI experiences."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What solutions are available for Privacy & Security?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Knox Vault is a hardware-based security solution that safeguards your device from software and hardware attacks by protecting sensitive data, including PINs, passwords and biometric data in an isolated, secure environment.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• Software attacks: </b>Unauthorized attempts to access and steal data by exploiting software vulnerabilities on a device.\r\n<br/><br/>\r\n<b>• Hardware attacks: </b>Attempts to at